BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bobcat-trail-races-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261011T000000Z
DTSTART:20261017T070000Z
DTEND:20261017T110000Z
SUMMARY:Bobcat Trail Races
DESCRIPTION:Bobcat Trail Races feature one of Colorado Springs' best city parks\, Palmer Park. Runners will enjoy views of the city and Pikes Peak from the rocky bluffs. Multiple distance options (50K\, 25K\, 10K\, 5K) wind through diverse trails from technical single-track to rolling hills and rocky outcrops. Event includes aid stations\, crew support at start/finish\, and live tracking available.
LOCATION:Palmer Park\, 3650 Maizeland Rd\, Colorado Springs\, CO 80909
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:weekend-at-burney-runwalkcrawl-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261011T000000Z
DTSTART:20261022T180000Z
DTEND:20261022T220000Z
SUMMARY:Weekend at Burney Run/Walk/Crawl
DESCRIPTION:Weekend at Burney Run/Walk/Crawl is a laid-back\, high-fun trail event featuring a 4.8-mile looped course with 370 ft elevation gain per loop. The event offers multiple timed options (48-hour\, 24-hour\, 12-hour challenges) with a 50/50 mix of single-track and dirt service road terrain. Participants can run\, walk\, crawl\, or participate in the burro race. Cash prizes awarded for most miles\, with belt buckles for 100+ mile finishers and special ultra buckles for 100+ mile finishers in 24 hours. All participants completing loops earn medals.
LOCATION:22800 Guest Ranch Rd\, Cassel\, CA 96016
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
