UID:all-out-kooky-spooky-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261011T000000Z
DTSTART:20261101T090000Z
DTEND:20261101T130000Z
SUMMARY:All-Out Kooky-Spooky
DESCRIPTION:15th annual Halloween-themed run featuring 5K\, 10K\, and half marathon distances starting from Jefferson County's NAAC Stadium and winding along scenic Ralston Creek Trail. Official BOLDERBoulder qualifier event benefiting the Colorado National Kidney Foundation. Virtual options available. Costume contest\, medals for all distances\, and free parking included.
LOCATION:Ralston Creek Trail\, Golden\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:colorado-24-hour-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261011T000000Z
DTSTART:20261107T080000Z
DTEND:20261107T120000Z
SUMMARY:Colorado 24 Hour Run
DESCRIPTION:A community-focused timed event held on a scenic 1-mile flat dirt loop at the Swift Ponds Campus. Runners can push their limits to see how far they can go in a set amount of time\, with a festive atmosphere and shared meals throughout the day and night.
LOCATION:4927 County Rd 36\, Fort Collins\, CO 80528
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kessel-run-ultra-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261011T000000Z
DTSTART:20261107T060000Z
DTEND:20261107T100000Z
SUMMARY:Kessel Run Ultra
DESCRIPTION:Trail ultramarathon event located in North Fruita Desert\, Colorado featuring world-class single track trails with sweeping views of the San Juan Mountains and Colorado National Monument. All distances begin on fast\, flowing singletrack and progress to steep terrain on the Zippity-Do-Da Trail. Course elevations range from 5\,030' to 5\,541'. Event includes aid stations\, finisher's medal\, custom race shirt\, bib\, and BOCO Technical Trucker hat.
LOCATION:18 Road Parking\, Fruita\, CO (GPS: 39.31093\, -108.70360)
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
