UID:longmont-turkey-trot-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261011T000000Z
DTSTART:20261114T090000Z
DTEND:20261114T130000Z
SUMMARY:Longmont Turkey Trot
DESCRIPTION:The Longmont Turkey Trot is one of the fastest\, most scenic 10K and 2-mile courses in the area. Participants can run\, roll\, or walk past the finish line with wheelchair divisions available for the 10K race. Awards are given to top 3 finishers in multiple age groups and gender categories. Packet pick-up is Friday\, November 13\, 4-6pm at Longmont Recreation Center\, or on race day. Registration closes at 12pm Thursday\, November 12\, with late registration available November 13 and race morning.
LOCATION:Altona Middle School\, 4600 Clover Basin Dr\, Longmont\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
