DTSTAMP:20261011T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T083000Z
DTEND:20261126T123000Z
SUMMARY:Gobble Wobble Run
DESCRIPTION:Gobble Wobble Run 5K on Thanksgiving Day. Features early packet pickup at Fleet Feet. 2026 beneficiary is the Colorado National Guard Foundation. Title sponsor is The Alan Smith Team at RE/MAX Professionals.
LOCATION:Clement Park\, Littleton\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:broomfield-turkey-day-5k10k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261011T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T090000Z
DTEND:20261126T130000Z
SUMMARY:Broomfield Turkey Day 5K/10K
DESCRIPTION:Colorado's only Thanksgiving Day 10K. Family-friendly fall event welcoming runners\, walkers\, and participants of all ages. Features finisher medals\, free pumpkin pie\, winter knit beanies\, chip timing\, live results\, free parking\, and a charity food drive for Broomfield FISH. Youth and team pricing available.
LOCATION:13200 Sheridan Blvd\, Broomfield County Commons\, Broomfield\, CO 80020
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:turkey-rock-trot-5k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261011T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T090000Z
DTEND:20261126T130000Z
SUMMARY:Turkey ROCK Trot 5k
DESCRIPTION:Plum Creek Church 22nd Annual Turkey ROCK Trot Presented by CORE. A Thanksgiving morning 5K family fun run/walk/stroll featuring a live DJ\, live music on course\, indoor health & wellness expo with 30+ vendors\, free food items\, face painting\, balloon twisting\, and bounce house. All proceeds benefit The Help&Hope Center. Features wave corrals\, multiple award categories\, and a costume contest.
LOCATION:Douglas County Event Center\, 500 Fairgrounds Drive\, Castle Rock\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
